  "bio": "Dario Sofo, a master of neotraditional tattoo artistry, is not only revered for his intricate designs but also for his exceptional professionalism. Clients flock to the heart of Rome to experience Dario's meticulous attention to detail within the inviting atmosphere of Subskin Tattoo. His dedication to his craft is matched only by the high standards of cleanliness he upholds, ensuring every session is as safe as it is transformative.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Rome, Latium, Italy\n\nTattoo Artist\nprivate studio close to Rome (Sacrofano)",
